(Exercise 15: MongoDB Multi-Tenant SaaS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This project demonstrates shared-collection tenant isolation, database-backed) Tj
T*
(rate limiting, and a safe migration to a dedicated database for one tenant.) Tj
T*
(It is an original implementation based on the Chapter 15 lab objectives.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Files) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  - lab_01_multitenant_api.py ? task create/list/update operations; every task) Tj
T*
(  query is scoped by tenant_id. Updates require both _id and tenant_id.) Tj
T*
(  - lab_02_tenant_migration.py ? dry-run, idempotent migration, and rollback.) Tj
T*
(  Migration copies data and never deletes the shared source documents.) Tj
T*
(  - demo_runner.py ? exercises tenant isolation, rate limiting, and repeated) Tj
T*
(  migration against a MongoDB instance.) Tj
T*
(  - generate_submission_pdf.py ? creates the submission PDF from this README) Tj
T*
(  using only the Python standard library.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Run locally) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Python 3.10+ and MongoDB are required. Install dependencies:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`sh) Tj
T*
(python -m pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
T*
(`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Set MONGODB_URI if MongoDB is not available at the local default, then run:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`sh) Tj
T*
(python demo_runner.py) Tj
T*
(python -m unittest discover -s tests -v) Tj
T*
(python generate_submission_pdf.py) Tj
T*
(`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The demo creates records for demo-acme and demo-globex in saas_app, then) Tj
T*
(copies demo-acme records to tenant_demo-acme. It intentionally does not) Tj
T*
(delete demo data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Migration commands) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`sh) Tj
T*
(python lab_02_tenant_migration.py --tenant customer-42 --dry-run) Tj
T*
(python lab_02_tenant_migration.py --tenant customer-42) Tj
T*
(python lab_02_tenant_migration.py --tenant customer-42 --rollback) Tj
T*
(`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The source is saas_app.tasks by default. Migration upserts on the stable) Tj
T*
(task_key generated when a task is created. If a source record lacks that key,) Tj
T*
(the migration stops before writing it. Rollback drops only) Tj
T*
ET
