() Tj
T*
(Tenant isolation and rate limiting) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The shared tasks collection stores a tenant_id on each record. list_tasks) Tj
T*
(filters by that ID, and update_task uses the combined filter) Tj
T*
({"_id": task_id, "tenant_id": tenant_id}. A task identifier from one tenant) Tj
T*
(therefore cannot be used to update another tenant's task.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Rate-limit counters are atomically incremented in MongoDB using one document) Tj
T*
(per tenant and fixed time window. The configurable default is 100 requests per) Tj
T*
(60 seconds. This is intentionally a modest-precision limiter, not a substitute) Tj
T*
(for a distributed gateway in high-throughput production systems.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tests) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The unit tests use mocked MongoDB collections and require no running server:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`sh) Tj
T*
(python -m unittest discover -s tests -v) Tj
T*
(`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Assignment reference: Chapter 15 lab description.) Tj
T*
